flowchart TB
accTitle: Bound queue age before sending a location offer
accDescr: A durable queue separates mobile ingestion from processing. Workers discard stale locations and send eligible offers through the device platform's mobile push service.
M[Authenticated location event and timestamp]:::inputData --> Q[(SQS)]:::storage
Q --> W[Scaled EC2 workers]:::process
W --> F{Location still fresh?}:::decision
F -->|No| X[Discard stale event]:::warning
F -->|Yes| D[(DynamoDB nearby offers)]:::storage
D -->|Worker publishes matching offer| S[SNS mobile endpoint]:::process
S --> P[Platform push service]:::external
P --> U[User device]:::output
A[Monitor backlog age and total latency]:::reference -.-> W
